{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-sage-of-spiritual-freedom","title":"精神自由的宗师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-sage-of-spiritual-freedom","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":2034,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章对庄子作出综合评价。&quot;精神自由的宗师&quot;，是对庄子崇高地位最贴切的尊称——他作为道家的集大成者、精神自由的开拓者、人类的心灵导师，为人类的精神开辟了一片自由的天地。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其卓越贡献与崇高境界，又客观正视围绕其思想的种种探讨与争议，以辩证的眼光，认识这位不朽的智者。</p>\n"}